---
import '../styles/global.css';

interface Props {
  title?: string;
  description?: string;
  current?: 'map' | 'emergency' | 'toolbox';
}

const { title, description = '一边学、一边记录自家猫的养猫知识笔记库', current } = Astro.props;
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const fullTitle = title ? `${title} · 猫咪知识笔记库` : '猫咪知识笔记库';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={`${base}favicon.svg`} />
    <title>{fullTitle}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="wrap header-inner">
        <a class="brand" href={base}>
          <img src={`${base}favicon.svg`} alt="" width="22" height="22" />
          <span>猫咪知识笔记库</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="主导航">
          <a href={base} aria-current={current === 'map' ? 'page' : undefined}>地图</a>
          <a href={`${base}toolbox/`} aria-current={current === 'toolbox' ? 'page' : undefined}>工具箱</a>
          <a class="nav-sos" href={`${base}emergency/`} aria-current={current === 'emergency' ? 'page' : undefined}>
            急症清单
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <slot />
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p>这里是学习笔记，内容尚未经兽医审核，不能代替兽医的诊断。猫的情况拿不准时，直接联系兽医。</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
